Postbeam includes an adapted copy of the Elixir conversion of gen_smtp.

The SMTP/LMTP client and server, MIME codec, DKIM signer, socket utilities,
RFC grammars and regression tests originate from gen_smtp:
https://github.com/gen-smtp/gen_smtp

The integrated version lives under Postbeam.SMTP and is built as part of the
postbeam application. The original module copyright notices are retained.
The BSD-2-Clause and MIT license texts are in licenses/.

